  "document": "Joseph W. Smiley\nJoseph W. Smiley was born on June 18, 1870 in Boston, Massachusetts, USA. He was an actor and director, known for \"The Gray Horror\" (1915), \"The Other Sister\" (1915) and \"The Living Fear\" (1914), as well as many other films. He was married to the Scottish actress Lila Leslie. He died on December 2, 1945, in New York City, New York, USA."
